4. BUNDLED DATASETS
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   Bundled datasets

   Nooral bundles the following open datasets. All other datasets in Nooral are
   generated or written for Nooral and are covered by its own licence.

   - Iris (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/): Fisher, R.
     A. (1936). Iris [Dataset]. UCI Machine Learning Repository.
     https://doi.org/10.24432/C56C76. Licensed under CC BY 4.0. Values as in the
     original 1936 paper (two entries differ from the repository file). Changes:
     stored in a compact numeric form (integers with a per-column number of
     decimals); category columns are stored as indices.
